// AMA liveness check - is the agent alive and reporting to the workspace?
// Empty / "table not found" shortly after DCR association = propagation, not failure.
// SCAgentChannel "Direct" confirms the per-machine AMA path (not WEF/WEC).
Heartbeat
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30m)
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Category, Version, SCAgentChannel
| order by TimeGenerated desc
